{"sourceUrl":"https://life.fudan.edu.cn/3c/9c/c28139a736412/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:04.419480+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://life.fudan.edu.cn/3c/9c/c28139a736412/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>复</span><span>旦大学生命科学学院具有悠久的历史、一流的师资与浓郁的</span><span>学</span><span>术氛围，</span><span>拥有生物学和生态学两个一级学科，复杂性状的遗传调控全国重点实验室</span><span>、湿地环境保护与生态修复全国重点实验室（共建）、</span><span>长江河口湿地生态系统国家野外科学观测研究站</span><span>等三</span><span>个</span><span>国家</span><span>级</span><span>平台和四个省部级平台</span><span><span>。2023年国家批准成立复旦大学生物学国家高层次人才培养中心，是全国首批4个国家级生物学学科高层次人才培养中心之一。</span><span>培</span></span><span><span>养了童第周、冯德培、陈世骧</span>3位第一代学部委员，15位两院院士和3位美国科学院院士。近几年，基础研究和成果转化都取得了瞩目的</span><span>成绩。</span></p><p><span>为促进全国</span><span>高校</span><span>2026<span>年优秀应届</span></span><span>本科</span><span>毕业生之间的交流，增进对</span><span>我单位</span><span>研究生教育的</span><span>深入</span><span>了解，激发同学们对</span><span>生命科学前沿</span><span>的兴趣，</span><span>鼓励将来申请我单位推荐免试研究生，</span><span>特举办本次夏令营活动</span><span>。报名阶段相关事宜通知如下：</span><span> </span></p><p><span>一、报名时间</span></p><p><span>6<span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span><span>10:00</span></span><span> </span><span>-</span><span> </span><span>6<span>月</span><span>25</span><span>日</span><span>17:00</span></span></p><p><span>二、报名条件</span></p><p><span>1.<span>全国各高等学校</span><span>2026</span><span>年应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>学</span></span><span>业</span><span>成绩优秀</span><span>，预期可获得推荐免试资格</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>具有一定</span><span>的</span><span>学术</span><span>科研能力或潜力。</span></p><p><span>三、报名材料</span></p><p><span>1.<span>近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版</span><span>JPG</span><span>格式，</span><span>150×200</span><span>像素，大小</span><span>500K</span><span>以内。</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>本科阶段</span></span><span>现有完整</span><span><span>成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章），</span>JPG<span>或</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式。</span></span></p><p><span>3.<span>外语水平证明，如</span><span>CET-4</span><span>、</span><span>CET-6</span><span>、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等。</span></span></p><p><span>4.<span>有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作。</span></span></p><p><span>5.<span>诚信承诺书（可从报考服务系统下载，签名后上传）。</span></span></p><p><span>6.</span><span><span>直博生需通过报考系统提交</span><span>2</span><span>封推荐信。</span></span></p><p><span>四、报名方式</span></p><p><span><span>申请人登录复旦大学研究生招生网（</span>https://gsao.fudan.edu.cn<span>）</span><span>,</span><span>通过</span><span>“</span><span>研究生报考服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>中的</span><span>“</span><span>全国优秀大学生夏令营</span><span>”</span><span>进行网上报名。</span></span></p><p><span>招收专业：</span><span>071000</span><span> <span>生物学和</span><span>071300 </span><span>生态学</span></span></p><p><span>招收类型：直博生和硕士生</span></p><p><span>我单位无需考生寄送纸质材料。</span></p><p><span>五</span><span>、</span><span>相关说明</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span>本次夏令营活动规模（拟参照往年）</span><span>，</span><span><span>本次活动预计在</span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>日</span><span>- </span></span><span>8</span><span>日举行。</span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>提供免费食、宿（上海高校大学生一般不提供住宿）。</span></span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.<span>营员遴选结果</span></span><span><span>拟于报名结束后</span><span>1</span></span><span>0</span><span>个工作日内</span><span>通过复旦大学研究生报考服务系统发布。</span></p><p><span>4</span><span>.<span>申请人应承诺填报信息和提交材料的真实性。如有弄虚作假，一经发现将取消</span></span><span>申请</span><span>资格</span><span>并通报其本科院校</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>5</span><span>.</span><span><span>有意报考我单位</span><span>2026</span><span>级</span></span><span>学术学位</span><span>推免研究生的同学（含本校本科生），应申请参加本次夏令营活动</span><span>，</span><span>我单位后期</span><span>学术学位</span><span>是否举办其他推免相关活动，另行通知。</span><span><span>专业学位（生物与医药专业和资源与环境专业）推免生预选拔预计在</span><span>9月份时开放报名。如果上级部门和学校关于夏令营活动有新要求，我单位将按新要求执行并及时通知申请人。</span></span></p><p><span>6</span><span>.<span>咨询方式：</span></span><span>021-31246508，邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:life_gs@fudan.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>life_gs@fudan.edu.cn</span></span></a></p><p><span>                            </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>                         复旦大学</span><span>生命科学学院</span></p><p><span>                                                                                                                                    </span><span>2025<span>年</span>6<span>月</span></span><span>9</span><span>日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>附件：</span></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://life.fudan.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_xls.gif\"/><a href=\"https://life.fudan.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/b2/91/0fc64fd945e78bf5bdbd0b601c51/24c01817-3785-4f4e-bb5c-521708c1b097.xlsx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究方向关键词汇总.xlsx</a><br/>（<span>同学们可以通过上表快速查询感兴趣研究方向的导师</span>）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://life.fudan.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/b2/91/0fc64fd945e78bf5bdbd0b601c51/7ada88e0-c467-4986-b551-e96fb59da2a3.png\"/></p><p><span></span>研招宣传微场景欢迎扫码，转发!</p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span></span><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"bfaeb26dfe3019e3a682b2718e55ea7892f217604d65739480ba47f9f48e7be7","textLength":1209,"sourceSha256":"da26c52f083a5ae3ae8d593173fff11df0078a7205e58ad54f5133b503f10277","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-95c0c690cf63aeb25237","title":"2025年复旦大学生命科学学院复杂性状的遗传调控全国重点实验室生物学国家高层次人才培养中心2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:04.419480+00:00"}
